.nh
.TH "LAGO" "1" "Sep 2026" "Lago CLI" "Lago CLI Manual"

.SH NAME
lago-v2-payment-requests-create - Create payment request


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlago v2 payment-requests create [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Requires a premium license. Selected customer invoices must be overdue, ready for payment processing, and share the same currency and billing entity. Payment collection and email delivery are asynchronous.
Requires the product catalog to be enabled and payment_request write permission on the API key.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--email\fP=""
	Recipient email. Defaults to the customer email.

.PP
\fB--external-customer-id\fP=""
	External customer identifier.

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for create

.PP
\fB--input\fP=""
	Complete JSON request body or @file.json

.PP
\fB--lago-invoice-ids\fP=""
	Customer invoices to include.

.PP
\fB--payment-method-payment-method-id\fP=""
	Identifier of a payment method belonging to the customer.

.PP
\fB--payment-method-payment-method-type\fP=""
	How the payment is collected.; one of: provider, manual


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--api-key\fP=""
	Override the Lago API key

.PP
\fB--api-url\fP=""
	Override the Lago API URL

.PP
\fB--confirm\fP=""
	Confirm a dangerous operation with its resource identifier

.PP
\fB--dry-run\fP[=false]
	Print mutating requests without sending them

.PP
\fB--insecure\fP[=false]
	Allow insecure HTTP or TLS for self-hosted Lago

.PP
\fB--mode\fP=""
	Environment mode: live or test

.PP
\fB--no-retry\fP[=false]
	Disable automatic retries

.PP
\fB-o\fP, \fB--output\fP="table"
	Output format: table, json, or yaml

.PP
\fB--profile\fP=""
	Named profile to use

.PP
\fB--query\fP=""
	JMESPath expression applied to the response

.PP
\fB--timeout\fP=30s
	Total request timeout

.PP
\fB--timing\fP[=false]
	Print request latency breakdown

.PP
\fB--verbose\fP[=false]
	Print redacted request and response details


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  lago v2 payment-requests create --input @payload.json
  lago v2 payment-requests create --input @payload.json --output json  # full resource
.EE


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBlago-v2-payment-requests(1)\fP
